WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.569
- Now I know this plan
is foolproof.

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:05.271
Check this out.

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:06.506
First of all,

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.642
you and me start
working at the bank.

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:11.144
Doesn't matter the position,
okay,

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.312
just so long as we get
in there, all right?

00:00:13.345 --> 00:00:15.681
Then we just go there every day,

00:00:15.714 --> 00:00:18.051
do the work, gain their trust

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.420
until we get them
in the palm of our hand.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.088
- All right.

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:23.623
So how we get the money?

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.725
- That's the beauty of it, bro.

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:29.429
They deposit the money
into our bank accounts,

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.696
week after week,

00:00:30.729 --> 00:00:32.298
month after month.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:34.333
They're not even gonna know
they're being robbed.

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:37.670
And then 20 or 30 years later,

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:40.139
we walk out the front door

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:43.043
like nothing even happened.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.149
- Mother [beep],
that's called a job!

